* text=auto eol=lf
*.php  text eol=lf diff=php
*.md   text eol=lf
*.txt  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.lua  text eol=lf
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary

# Keep distributions lean (applies to `git archive`, GitHub release archives and Packagist dist downloads).
# The adapter packages under packages/ are developed here and split into their own repositories at release; they are
# not part of the enaxon/reqtide distribution.
# The dist keeps exactly: src/ (including src/Testing), docs/ (including docs/llms.txt), composer.json, README.md,
# LICENSE, NOTICE and CHANGELOG.md. UPGRADE.md stays in the repository only. The community files (CONTRIBUTING,
# CODE_OF_CONDUCT, SECURITY, SUPPORT, RELEASING) live in .github/ and are therefore excluded with it.
/.github/               export-ignore
/tests/                 export-ignore
/tools/                 export-ignore
/benchmarks/            export-ignore
/packages/              export-ignore
/examples/              export-ignore
/UPGRADE.md             export-ignore
/phpunit.xml.dist       export-ignore
/phpstan.neon.dist      export-ignore
/infection.json5        export-ignore
/.php-cs-fixer.dist.php export-ignore
/.gitattributes         export-ignore
/.gitignore             export-ignore
/.editorconfig          export-ignore
/composer.lock          export-ignore
